{"tool_name":"neuritetracer","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>\"The plugin analyzes fluorescence microscopy images of neurites and nuclei of dissociated cultured neurons. Given user-defined thresholds, the plugin counts neuronal nuclei, and traces and measures neurite length.\"[...]\" NeuriteTracer is a fast simple-to-use ImageJ plugin for the analysis of outgrowth in two-dimensional fluorescence microscopy images of neuronal cultures. The plugin performed well on images from three different types of neurons with distinct morphologies.\"</p>\n\n<p>This plugin requires parameter setting: Threshold levels and scale (see more details on the related publication)</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>\"The plugin analyzes fluorescence microscopy images of neurites and nuclei of dissociated cultured neurons. Given user-defined thresholds, the plugin counts neuronal nuclei, and traces and measures neurite length.\"[...]\" NeuriteTracer is a fast simple-to-use ImageJ plugin for the analysis of outgrowth in two-dimensional fluorescence microscopy images of neuronal cultures. The plugin performed well on images from three different types of neurons with distinct morphologies.\"</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This plugin requires parameter setting: Threshold levels and scale (see more details on the related publication)</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2025-10-28T01:39:57+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-01-28T11:18:13+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[{"cid":null,"comment_count":null,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":null,"last_comment_uid":null,"status":2}],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4212,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"13730f21-9367-4730-ba0e-a6dbfd2fdab5","url":"/taxonomy/term/4212"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1